    <pre class="lost-log" aria-label="Error details">Panorama: <span class="hl">&lt;img&gt;</span> in player name
Payload: <span class="lost-payload" data-lost-payload></span>
Image requests sent: 0. IPs leaked: 0. Players kicked: 0.</pre>
    <p class="lead">Late 2023: CS2 rendered HTML in player names, so a name like this pulled a remote image straight into everyone's vote-kick panel, and with it, everyone's IP address. Valve patched it fast. This page never fetches your image, so nobody's IP goes anywhere. Your vote still counts, though.</p>
  </div>

